& [ExpectationAuthority] is reviewed plain meaning over exact immutable case identity before observation classification
& [ObservationAuthority] is actual stage output under exact bound execution identity
& [ComparisonAuthority] is deterministic classification preserving both expectation and observation
& [AdmissionAuthority] is a separate reviewed transition that verifies completeness without changing prior evidence

& [ReviewerPrincipal] is a person or authorized faculty process with stable identity trust basis and provenance
& [ReviewRun] is one immutable invocation of one faculty profile over one exact input digest
& [IndependenceClass] is procedural_only separate_invocations or separate_principals

& [PrimaryReceipt] is one faculty's independent disposition evidence and rationale
& [CrossAcknowledgment] is one faculty's inspection disposition over both primary receipt digests
& [CrossConfirmationEnvelope] binds two primaries two acknowledgments independence class and trust evidence without recursion

& [IntegrityDigest] identifies exact content
& [Attestation] binds reviewer identity role disposition and protocol
& [DigitalSignature] is verified cryptographic evidence under a trusted key catalogue
  + these identities are non-substitutive

& [Dissent] is affirm challenge abstain or insufficient_evidence with stable successor-preserving identity
& [RefinedDisposition] is independent_review_protocol_formation
